usage: ./build/limine-binary/limine <command> <args...>

    --print-datadir   Print the directory containing the bootloader files

    --version         Print the Limine version (like the `version` command)

    --help | -h       Display this help message

Commands: `help`, `version`, `bios-install`, `enroll-config`
Use `--help` after specifying the command for command-specific help.
